Package: linux-image-@major@@localversion@@extraversion@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-image-@upstreamversion@@abiname@@localversion@, linux-modules-@major@@localversion@@extraversion@
Description: Linux @major@@extraversion@ image on @class@
 This package depends on the latest binary image for Linux kernel @major@@extraversion@
 on @longclass@ machines.

Package: linux-modules@localversion@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-modules-@major@@localversion@@extraversion@
Description: Linux modules on @class@
 This package depends on the latest pre-built loadable modules for Linux kernel
 on @longclass@ machines.

Package: linux-modules-@major@@localversion@@extraversion@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-modules-@upstreamversion@@abiname@@localversion@
Provides: linux-latest-modules-@upstreamversion@@abiname@@localversion@
Description: Linux @major@@extraversion@ modules on @class@
 This package depends on the latest pre-built loadable modules for Linux kernel
 @major@@extraversion@ on @longclass@ machines.

